[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/owner/jobranger/pulls/89","id":2000000002,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAAAAA88AAAAAdzWUAg","html_url":"https://github.com/owner/jobranger/pull/89","diff_url":"https://github.com/owner/jobranger/pull/89.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/owner/jobranger/pull/89.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/owner/jobranger/issues/89","number":89,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"feat(CLI-13): add email delivery","user":{"login":"owner","id":1,"node_id":"U_1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/owner","html_url":"https://github.com/owner","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owner/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owner/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owner/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owner/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owner/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owner/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owner/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owner/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/owner/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## What does this PR do?\n\n- Adds the `Delivery` step, which sends the digest email over SMTP with MailKit or over Resend. No command calls it on this branch, because `jobranger run` is the next PR, stacked on this one.\n- After a server accepts the email, the code marks the ads in the digest as reported. A cancelled pass sends nothing and marks nothing.\n- Checks the SMTP certificate chain and host name, without an online revocation check.\n- Counts a Resend 2xx response as sent, without reading the response body.\n- When the secret store is broken, the code returns a failure. However, if the secrets file is corrupt, the code blocks only sends that use a login.\n- `Http/ForwardingStream` replaces the copied forwarding members in `ReadTimeoutStream` and `PenalizingStream`.\n- The email and the terminal report build each ad's entry, called a card, with `RunConversions.ToDigestCard`, which replaces a copy of the same mapping in the delivery code.\n\n## Why are you suggesting this change?\n\nThe CLI can build a digest but cannot send it. Ads must stay unreported until a server accepts the email, otherwise a failed send loses them.\n\n## JIRA Tickets\n\nTicket `#113`, closed by this PR.\n\n## Dependencies\n\n#74, #75, #76, #85 and other open PRs also change `--minimum-expected-tests` in `.github/workflows/cli.yml`, and CI fails when that value is above the number of tests that ran. Whichever PR merges last must set it to the total from its own `dotnet test` summary.\n\n## Known risks\n\n- A second delivery of the same run over SMTP sends a second mail. No caller delivers twice, and Resend drops a repeat through the idempotency key.\n- `FileSecretStore.cs:32` opens the secrets file outside `Guard`, the wrapper that turns a file error into a failure that names the path. #73 fixes this.\n- Real provider sends were not run, because all sends went to local Mailpit and a fake Resend server.\n- A real keychain, valid NTLM, CRAM and SCRAM logins, and certificate checks against the macOS trust store were not run.\n\n## Automated Testing\n\nAdded tests for SMTP and Resend sends, send failures in English and Norwegian, marking ads as reported, corrupt secrets files, idempotency keys and cancelled sends.\n","created_at":"2026-10-31T21:14:44Z","updated_at":"2026-11-02T12:30:25Z","closed_at":"2026-11-02T12:30:22Z","merged_at":"2026-11-02T12:30:22Z","merge_commit_sha":"eeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeeee","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/owner/jobranger/pulls/89/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/